@startuml معلمي Sequence Diagrams

skinparam shadowing false

' ==================== 1. User Registration & Login ====================

title 1. User Registration & Login Flow

actor Student
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "LanguageContext" as LC
participant "AuthService" as Auth
participant "Supabase Auth" as SA
participant "Users Table" as DB

Student -> UI: Click "Register"
UI -> UI: Show AuthModal (register mode)
Student -> UI: Fill name, email, password
UI -> Auth: register(name, email, password)
Auth -> SA: signUp({email, password})
SA --> Auth: {user, session}
Auth -> DB: INSERT user (id, email, full_name, role="STUDENT")
DB --> Auth: User record created
Auth --> UI: AuthResponse {user, session}
UI -> LC: login(user.name)
LC --> UI: isAuthenticated=true, userName set
UI --> Student: Redirect to Dashboard, show success toast

== Login Flow ==

Student -> UI: Click "Login"
UI -> UI: Show AuthModal (login mode)
Student -> UI: Fill email, password
UI -> Auth: login(email, password)
Auth -> SA: signInWithPassword({email, password})
SA --> Auth: {user, session}
Auth -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = user.id
DB --> Auth: User record
Auth --> UI: AuthResponse {user, session}
UI -> LC: login(user.name)
LC --> UI: isAuthenticated=true
UI --> Student: Redirect to Dashboard

' ==================== 2. Browse & Book a Teacher ====================

title 2. Browse Teachers & Book a Lesson

actor Student2 as Student
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "TeacherService" as TS
participant "BookingService" as BS
participant "Teachers API" as TAPI
participant "Bookings API" as BAPI
participant "Database" as DB

Student -> UI: Visit Homepage
UI -> TS: getFeaturedTeachers()
TS -> TAPI: GET /teachers?featured=true
TAPI -> DB: SELECT * FROM teachers WHERE is_featured=true
DB --> TAPI: Teacher[]
TAPI --> TS: PaginatedResponse<Teacher>
TS --> UI: Teacher[]
UI --> Student: Display FeaturedTeachersGrid

Student -> UI: Click "Book Now" on TeacherCard
UI -> UI: Navigate to /teacher/:id
UI -> TS: getTeacherById(id)
TS -> TAPI: GET /teachers/:id
TAPI -> DB: SELECT * FROM teachers WHERE id=:id
DB --> TAPI: Teacher
TAPI --> TS: Teacher
TS --> UI: Teacher data

Student -> UI: Select date, time, service
UI -> UI: Calculate total price
Student -> UI: Click "Confirm Booking"
UI -> BS: createBooking({teacher_id, service_id, date, start_time, end_time, notes})
BS -> BAPI: POST /bookings
note right
    Input: {
        "teacher_id": "uuid",
        "service_id": "uuid",
        "date": "2026-05-10",
        "start_time": "10:00",
        "end_time": "11:00",
        "notes": "Optional notes"
    }
end note
BAPI -> DB: INSERT INTO bookings (...)
DB --> BAPI: Booking record
BAPI --> BS: Booking {id, status="PENDING", ...}
BS --> UI: Booking confirmed
UI --> Student: Show BookingConfirmationToast

' ==================== 3. Teacher Onboarding ====================

title 3. Teacher Onboarding Flow

actor Teacher
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "TeacherService" as TS
participant "Teachers API" as TAPI
participant "Storage" as Store
participant "Database" as DB

Teacher -> UI: Click "Become a Teacher"
UI -> UI: Navigate to /onboarding
Teacher -> UI: Fill trilingual name, bio, specializations, rate, experience
Teacher -> UI: Upload avatar
UI -> Store: upload avatar to Storage
Store --> UI: avatar_url
Teacher -> UI: Click "Submit Application"
UI -> TS: createTeacherProfile(data)
TS -> TAPI: POST /teachers
note right
    Input: {
        "name": {"ar": "...", "en": "...", "de": "..."},
        "bio": {"ar": "...", "en": "...", "de": "..."},
        "specializations": [{"ar": "...", "en": "...", "de": "..."}],
        "hourly_rate": 25,
        "experience_years": 10,
        "avatar_url": "https://..."
    }
end note
TAPI -> DB: INSERT INTO teachers (is_approved=false)
DB --> TAPI: Teacher record
TAPI --> TS: Teacher
TS --> UI: Success
UI --> Teacher: Show success message "Application submitted"

' ==================== 4. Admin Approve Teacher ====================

title 4. Admin Approves Teacher

actor Admin
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "AdminService" as AS
participant "Admin API" as AAPI
participant "Database" as DB

Admin -> UI: Navigate to /admin
UI -> AS: getPendingTeachers()
AS -> AAPI: GET /admin/teachers?is_approved=false
AAPI -> DB: SELECT * FROM teachers WHERE is_approved=false
DB --> AAPI: Teacher[]
AAPI --> AS: Teacher[]
AS --> UI: Pending teachers list
UI --> Admin: Display pending teachers

Admin -> UI: Click "Approve" on teacher
UI -> AS: approveTeacher(teacherId)
AS -> AAPI: PATCH /admin/teachers/:id/approve
AAPI -> DB: UPDATE teachers SET is_approved=true WHERE id=:id
DB --> AAPI: Updated teacher
AAPI --> AS: Teacher {is_approved=true}
AS --> UI: Teacher approved
UI --> Admin: Show success toast, remove from pending list

' ==================== 5. Dashboard - View Lessons ====================

title 5. Student/Teacher Dashboard - View Lessons

actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "BookingService" as BS
participant "Bookings API" as BAPI
participant "Database" as DB

User -> UI: Navigate to /dashboard
UI -> BS: getBookingsByStudent(userId) OR getBookingsByTeacher(userId)
BS -> BAPI: GET /bookings?student_id=:id (or teacher_id)
BAPI -> DB: SELECT * FROM bookings WHERE student_id=:id AND status='CONFIRMED'
DB --> BAPI: Booking[]
BAPI --> BS: Booking[]
BS --> UI: Upcoming lessons list
UI --> User: Display lessons with "Join Lesson" button

User -> UI: Click "Join Lesson"
UI -> UI: Open meeting_url in new tab (Video SDK)

@enduml